WEBVTT

00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:03.480
Open Contacts in Omni Dispatch when you need to look up a partner.

00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:08.479
Use the directory filter to narrow the list and open Academy Logistics Desk.

00:00:08.890 --> 00:00:12.140
Contact Information shows the saved email and office phone.

00:00:12.609 --> 00:00:16.840
Location Information shows the coordinates this department recorded for the partner.

00:00:17.270 --> 00:00:20.309
A search and rescue dispatcher could use the same directory to

00:00:20.309 --> 00:00:21.860
look up an equipment coordinator.

00:00:22.029 --> 00:00:24.289
Open Chat and check the section you are in.

00:00:24.700 --> 00:00:26.080
Direct Messages, Channels

00:00:26.080 --> 00:00:29.269
and Incidents organize conversations by audience.

00:00:29.679 --> 00:00:34.109
Select Academy readiness under Channels to review its existing message.

00:00:34.470 --> 00:00:37.890
A community outreach team can use a shared channel to coordinate

00:00:37.890 --> 00:00:39.610
the staff handoff for a standby.

00:00:39.840 --> 00:00:43.639
Check the channel name above the conversation before typing a message.

00:00:43.990 --> 00:00:47.160
The composer has an Urgent switch and a Send button.

00:00:47.600 --> 00:00:50.590
In this exercise the equipment handoff stays unsent.

00:00:51.209 --> 00:00:55.329
A security dispatcher can use the same check before sharing a shift update.

00:00:55.549 --> 00:00:59.659
Open Assistant from the menu to reach the prompt field or start a new session.

00:01:00.270 --> 00:01:04.419
This screen shows where a department with Assistant configured can enter a question.

00:01:04.719 --> 00:01:09.120
For example, an industrial response coordinator could ask for help organizing

00:01:09.150 --> 00:01:11.049
a fictional exercise checklist.

00:01:11.370 --> 00:01:12.950
We leave the prompt blank here.

00:01:13.190 --> 00:01:16.639
In Settings, look under Preferences for Navigation App.

00:01:17.040 --> 00:01:21.790
The selector shows Device default, Google Maps and Waze on this workstation.

00:01:22.130 --> 00:01:25.180
The choice controls what opens when you start navigation from

00:01:25.180 --> 00:01:27.409
a call, destination or map pin.

00:01:27.769 --> 00:01:31.329
Review the choice before a shift where your team relies on those links.
